{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>神舟二十三將於今晚（24日）晚上11時08分於酒泉衛星發射中心發射場發射升空，香港首位太空人、女警司黎家盈將以「載荷專家」身份升空執行任務。當局今晚舉行出征儀式，在場人士拍手歡呼，三位航天員朱楊柱、張志遠、黎家盈向群眾揮手致。</p><p>黎家盈全程「露齒笑」，十分興奮，更向在場人士舉手指公，比朱楊柱和張志遠表現較為輕鬆。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260524/1135320229874765824584329.png/z_xe27tWeVlq-czEB4pXl2jVRWDgjiOKRZ74T0We-E8\" alt=\"出征儀式期間，黎家盈全程面帶笑容。（直播截圖）\"><figcaption>出征儀式期間，黎家盈全程面帶笑容。（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260524/1135319233044156416468109.jpeg/N5riXbMA7BIg1-1UyCeBYvI3oEko_Hdc--ttdvvrbXY\" alt=\"出征儀式期間，黎家盈全程面帶笑容。（直播截圖）\"><figcaption>出征儀式期間，黎家盈全程面帶笑容。（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260524/1135319230615523328091458.jpeg/Kx9xI-KWpu9N4baeP8ofCrXHvcoqdMx3QyQpy0MkKcs\" alt=\"出征儀式期間，黎家盈全程面帶笑容。（直播截圖）\"><figcaption>出征儀式期間，黎家盈全程面帶笑容。（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260524/1135319228174307328718246.jpeg/QDH2dd6suYxbYKjWF8zSvnZUQnEz8AbeR2SojEdkqIw\" alt=\"出征儀式期間，黎家盈（中）全程面帶笑容。（直播截圖）\"><figcaption>出征儀式期間，黎家盈（中）全程面帶笑容。（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260524/1135327608012017664156832.jpeg/_M1vUmFQKMqXUpenw6HHDq4hOX9OWbBRLp4hPS6eIT0\" alt=\"（直播截圖）\"><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260524/1135327610423873536309178.jpeg/wEsjZYtsNqAg-iWGSEu_PZjUE4F-cyVOeKSBpXikgaU\" alt=\"（直播截圖）\"><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260524/1135327612718288896915068.jpeg/0MsXaWpE_M9ovCXR0yU5hzZSGHjDftLmaQj8JGkI_CQ\" alt=\"（直播截圖）\"><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260524/1135327615084007424182053.jpeg/x56GUag0oEvCdlqXX3Dvb-DV3zz2fhG_9-o-B_fqPgc\" alt=\"（直播截圖）\"><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260524/1135327617386811392164590.jpeg/2SUcKvJpqxVdVv1vwHtWwZC34u6R7dhqdflNXXX5TV0\" alt=\"（直播截圖）\"><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260524/1135327607844245504503672.jpeg/nbTYIoGGBOLyB4FgqrQeaRmiKAwDNuJ3Gh3hThod4U4\" alt=\"（直播截圖）\"><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260524/1135327610352570368403215.jpeg/DWXhTSp37mivau1q8HwnfiYXqugY0FKUfgk8tn4JPLY\" alt=\"（直播截圖）\"><figcaption>（直播截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>在觀看的群眾中，有人手舉國旗與香港區旗，期間夾道群眾呼喊，「向航天員致敬，向航天員學習，祝你們成功等你們凱旋」。三位航天員朱楊柱、張志遠、黎家盈向人群揮手致意。</p><p>其後他們到達待命區，黎家盈表現冷靜，待工作人員幫忙整理衣物，又分別與另外兩人拍手互相鼓勵。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-24T13:18:46.063100+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":431,"images":11,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none"}}